ics-like">Ubernáculo meo, f et dixit mihi:] meis mitte radíces.</l><l xml:id="m-0c73d27c-0e4d-4fdf-991f-207b2a4d62ce" facs="#m-f721897d-7819-4d06-8104-a2a1e9e6de19" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Ave máris stélla. p. 1289.</l><l xml:id="m-fc1b3938-ad27-4a9f-b639-4f5ca1b8215d" facs="#m-8d8a8687-65cf-4296-8c89-02d7565b4d01" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedicta tu in muliéribus.</l><l xml:id="m-eb0d6a5a-2ad0-48bc-b11d-b69b53781445" facs="#m-9c864d91-5e94-4a89-b415-4715056c843e" label="lyrics-like">K. Et benedictus frúctus véntris túi.</l><l xml:id="m-8dab84cf-35e5-4a3e-87fa-e5f67db62f7d" facs="#m-7d95f498-fae0-475e-bd6a-e2a7777c0010" label="text-like">At Magn¬</l><l xml:id="m-6dbb30d1-0f22-4c86-a2ca-7c051a90f979" facs="#m-a75bc8d0-a605-4a7a-9cbf-951ae98e7b0b" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.E</l><l xml:id="m-98e5710f-71bf-4a4f-bc5c-07a7a01a0c7f" facs="#m-f624655b-f4a7-4e0e-90a3-d9613f80b8b5" label="lyrics-like">Atérni-tas tú- a,"Dé-i Génitrix Vírgo,</l><l xml:id="m-70357b37-761e-40ce-8904-b9e46f60d70f" facs="#m-e8ea942f-13ed-4e10-ae48-11e7e4d3fba5" label="lyrics-like">gáudi- um annunti-ávit uni-vérso múndo: ex te enim ór¬</l><l xml:id="m-e70d62c7-4265-486b-88b6-160f61a1abdf" facs="#m-ad76d8be-a5ff-457b-9da5-9997b7e0e0ae" label="lyrics-like">tus est sol justí ti-ae, Chrístus Dé-us nóster. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-f6839020-e126-4fa8-9a3e-7c31b6abe55e" facs="#m-7f828c86-2021-4a30-bcda-f4b897436ed1" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 4. E. p. 210, or p. 216.</l><l xml:id="m-514fe4d8-15a1-4d13-afd0-7ee3fa8e5977" facs="#m-e00b9bb7-0dbe-4947-a6a0-d4c8281251b4" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2230ebe9-12b1-4c25-83f9-424b58f511a4" facs="#m-8ecb2595-af6b-4bd1-8635-d8ff04336a3b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui de beâtae Maríae Vir-] ut, qui vere eam Genitricem Dei</l><l xml:id="m-3dfbd39c-69f0-47f0-8b28-c5a8ea7f7eec" facs="#m-5fb7e474-6953-4491-897d-ac4a2af35d76" label="lyrics-like">I ginis útero Verbum tuum, An-[crédimus, * ejus apud te interces¬</l><l x